# Teachers: "as professoras só ficam como alunas no código, mas continuam como professoras".
# A freed teacher sits in a student seat only in the code: {role} is still teacher, {free} yes once her event is over.
# {tcause} why she is in this mood today, from her job (Teachers.Cause): raise | results | praise | grading | lessons |
# staffparty | parents | principal | complaint | ignored | meeting | staffroom | nolunch. {whorole} and {otherrole}:
# teacher | student, for the person the fact is about and the other girl in the talk with both. Names of teachers come
# with -sensei in {who}, {who2}, {src} and {other}.

# ================= the player's own lines =================
@rule me.day.teacher
on me.day
when role=teacher
- {classes}[Good morning, sensei.|Hello, sensei.|Sensei, hi.] [How's your day going?|Busy day?|How are the classes today?]
- [You look busy, sensei.|Got a minute, sensei?] [How have you been?|Is it a good day?]
- {classes}[Sensei, how's the faculty room today?|How's teaching treating you today, sensei?]

@rule me.day.teacher.close
on me.day
when role=teacher rel=girlfriend|lover
- {classes}[Hey... nobody's around, so: how's your day?|Sensei. How's my favorite professor?]
- [Hard day at work?|How's your day, really?] [You can tell me.|I'm listening.]
- [Did you get any rest, sensei?|You look like you need a break.]

@rule me.small.future.teacher
on me.small
when subject=future role=teacher
- {classes}[Did you always want to be a professor?|Do you see yourself here in five years?|Will you stay at this university?]
- {classes}[What would you do if you weren't teaching?|Any plans beyond this university, sensei?]
- [Do you ever think about doing something else?|What was your dream at my age?]

@rule me.gossip.teacher
on me.gossip
when role=teacher
- {classes}[Sensei, what's the talk in the faculty room?|Heard anything interesting from the other professors?]
- {classes}[You must hear everything, sensei.|Professors talk too, right?] [Any news?|What's going around?]
- [Anything happen that students aren't supposed to know?|Come on, sensei, one little secret?]

# ================= how her day is, from her job =================
# ================= your options when she tells you about her day =================
@rule move.comfort.teacher
on move.comfort
when kind=day role=teacher
- {classes}[Tell her she's a good professor|Say the class is lucky to have her|Tell her she works too hard|Offer to help with something]
- {classes}[Say her lectures are the clearest you've had|Tell her to take a real break today|Say the students talk well of her]

@rule move.tease.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=day role=teacher
- {classes}[Joke about professors' lives|Ask for easier assignments|Tease her, sensei or not|Ask if that means no test]
- {classes}[Ask if professors get homework too|Say she'd fail her own pop quiz|Ask what she does when nobody's grading]

# ================= when you ask her why =================
@rule react.comfort.teacher
on react
when move=comfort role=teacher fit=good
feel smile
- {classes}[Now the student is comforting the professor.|Look at you, taking care of your professor.] [I should be embarrassed.|Thank you. Really.]
- [That helped more than you'd think.|I'll get through {mything} now.] [Don't let it go to your head.|Back to work, then.]
- {classes}[You're a good kid.|You're kinder than I expected.] [I'll go easier on you in class.|That wasn't a bribe, was it?]

@rule react.praise.teacher
on react
when move=praise role=teacher fit=good
feel shy
- {classes}[Flattery won't change your grade.|You know I can't give you points for that.] [...But thank you.|...Say it again.]
- [Students don't usually say that to me.|Oh my.] [I'm supposed to be the one handing out praise.|I don't know where to look.]
- {classes}[Ahem. Thank you.|That's very sweet.] [Now, back to your studies.|I'll remember that at report time. Kidding.]

@rule react.tease.teacher
on react
when move=tease role=teacher fit=good|neutral
feel laugh
- {classes}[Are you teasing your professor?|Bold, for someone with a test on Monday.] [{laugh}|I'm writing that down.]
- {classes}[I can give you extra assignments, you know.|Do you want to clean the lecture hall?] [{laugh}|Just a reminder.]
- {classes}[You wouldn't talk like that in class.|Say that in front of everyone.] [Coward.|{laugh}]

@rule react.invite.teacher.free
on react
when move=invite role=teacher free=yes fit=good|neutral
feel smile
- [Going out with a student...|If anyone on campus found out...] [Somewhere far from here, then.|Fine, but I never said yes.]
- {classes}[I'd have to pretend I ran into you by accident.|If anyone asks, it's extra tutoring.] [Understood?|Don't smile like that.]
- {classes}[I still have papers to grade.|That's a terrible idea.] [They can wait.|Which is why I'm saying yes.]

@rule react.invite.teacher.gf
on react
when move=invite role=teacher rel=girlfriend|lover fit=good
feel love
- [Far from campus, like always.|Not near the station, someone might see.] [I'll be there.|I've been looking forward to it.]
- [Out of uniform, please.|Call me by my name when we're there.] [Just for the day.|You know the rules.]
- [I'll bring the car around the corner.|Wait for me two stops down.] [Don't be late.|Hehe.]

# ================= the two of you: she has a job to lose =================
@rule us.teacher
on us
when role=teacher
feel smile
hook f_us_teacher
opens share,tease,ask
- [About {mything}... you know you're my student, right?|I keep thinking about {mything}.] [I shouldn't.|That's what worries me.]
- [Don't bring up {mything} near the faculty room.|Keep {mything} between us.] [Please.|I mean it.]
- {classes}[Other professors have normal problems.|I've been a professor for years, and then {mything}.] [What are you doing to me?|Hm.]

@rule us.teacher.dating
on us
when role=teacher rel=girlfriend|lover
feel love
hook f_us_teacher_dating
opens share,tease,invite
- {classes}[In class I call you by your last name, and then {mything}.|Every time I take attendance I think of {mything}.] [It's torture.|Don't you dare smile back.]
- [I could lose my job, you know.|If the dean knew...] [And I still don't regret {mything}.|I'd do {mything} again.]
- [After you graduate, nobody can say anything.|We only have to hide until you graduate.] [I'm counting the days.|Be patient with me.]

@rule us.teacher.h
on us
when role=teacher realverb=had_h
feel shy
hook f_us_teacher_h
opens share,tease,invite
- {classes}[We can't talk about that here.|Lower your voice.] [There's a class next door.|I'm still your professor.]
- {classes}[I stood in front of the class the next morning.|I couldn't look at your desk.] [After what we did.|I lost my place in the textbook.]
- [I've never done anything like that with a student.|I told myself it would be once.] [...It wasn't, was it?|You're a bad influence.]

# ================= what they say about you and a teacher =================
@rule you.h.teacher.saw
on you
when realverb=had_h how=witness whorole=teacher role=student
feel worried
hook f_you_h_teacher_saw
opens admit,hush,deny
- [You did it with the professor?!|With {who}?! Your own professor?!|I saw you and {who}. {who}!] [In the {fplace}!|I'll never sit through that class again.|How am I supposed to look at either of you?]
- [I know what I saw {when}.|{When}, in the {fplace}...] [You and a professor.|That was {who}, wasn't it?] [Do you know what happens if the university finds out?|She could lose her job!]
- [Of all the people...|I thought I'd seen everything.] [A professor?!|{who}?!] [What is wrong with you?|Tell me I imagined it.]

@rule you.h.teacher.heard
on you
when realverb=had_h how=heard|rumor whorole=teacher role=student
feel worried
hook f_you_h_teacher_heard
opens deny,admit,hush
- [Is it true you did it with the professor?!|People are saying you and {who}...] [With a professor?!|That can't be real.]
- [The whole class is whispering about you and {who}.|I heard something crazy.] [You didn't, right?|Tell me you didn't.]
- [Please say it's a rumor.|Someone says you've been staying after class with {who}.] [Because of the "extra lessons".|And not for assignments.]

@rule you.h.teacher.gf
on you
when realverb=had_h whorole=teacher role=student rel=girlfriend|lover
feel pout
hook f_you_h_teacher_gf
opens admit,deny,comfort
- [You cheated on me with a professor?!|With {who}! Our professor!] [How do I sit in that class now?|Was I not grown up enough for you?]
- [I have to look at her at the blackboard!|She takes attendance and says my name!] [After what you did with her!|Do you have any idea how that feels?]
- [{who}, of all people.|A professor. You chose a professor.] [Explain. Now.|I can't even tell anyone.]

@rule you.h.teacher.open
on you
when realverb=had_h whorole=teacher role=student profile=open
feel laugh
hook f_you_h_teacher_open
opens tease,admit,hush
- [Wait, wait. You and the professor?!|{who}?! Seriously?!] [Legend.|I need every detail.]
- [So that's why your grades went up!|Extra lessons, huh?] [Ha!|What's next, the dean?]
- [Okay, I'm impressed.|I didn't think you had it in you.] [A professor!|Is she different after class?]

@rule you.romance.teacher
on you
when realverb=started_dating|dated|kissed|flirted|held_hands whorole=teacher role=student
feel worried
hook f_you_romance_teacher
opens deny,admit,tease
- [You and the professor?!|What's going on with you and {who}?] [She's a professor!|You know that's not allowed, right?]
- [I heard about you and {who}.|People saw you with {who}.] [A professor, really?|Are you trying to get expelled?]
- [Is that why you stay after class?|So {who} is why you've been so eager in class?] [I have questions.|Unbelievable.]

@rule you.h.student.teacher
on you
when realverb=had_h role=teacher whorole=student
feel serious
hook f_you_h_student_teacher
opens admit,hush,deny
- {classes}[With one of my students.|I teach her, you know.|{who} sits in my class.] [I saw enough {when}.|Do I need to call the dean?]
- {classes}[As a professor I should report this.|We need to talk, you and I.] [Sit down.|Close the door.]
- [I can't pretend I didn't see that.|Do you know what the rules say?] [{who} is my responsibility.|Give me one reason not to go to the dean.]

@rule you.h.student.teacher.jealous
on you
when realverb=had_h role=teacher whorole=student rel=girlfriend|lover
feel sad
hook f_you_h_student_teacher_jealous
opens admit,deny,comfort
- {classes}[With {who}.|A girl from my own class.] [Someone your age.|I suppose that makes sense. I suppose.]
- {classes}[I have to teach her tomorrow.|I can't exactly complain to anyone, can I?] [Who would I tell?|That's the worst part.]
- [I knew this could happen.|I'm older than you, I know how this goes.] [I still hate it.|Say something.]

@rule you.h.colleague
on you
when realverb=had_h role=teacher whorole=teacher
feel serious
hook f_you_h_colleague
opens admit,hush,tease
- {classes}[{who} told me.|I share a faculty room with {who}, you know.] [We need to have a talk, young man.|Do you think professors don't talk?]
- {classes}[With my colleague.|With {who}, of all the professors.] [I'll be sitting next to her at the meeting.|How bold.]
- {classes}[I can't decide who to scold first.|Two professors. You have some nerve.] [You or her.|Sit down.]

@rule you.romance.student.teacher
on you
when realverb=started_dating|dated|kissed|flirted|held_hands role=teacher whorole=student
feel smile
hook f_you_romance_student_teacher
opens admit,tease,deny
- {classes}[So you and {who}.|I notice who passes notes in my class.] [Young love.|Don't let it hurt your grades.]
- {classes}[I saw you with {who}.|Professors see everything, you know.] [Be good to her.|Keep it out of the lecture hall.]
- [{who} has been staring at the door all day.|I wonder why {who} is so distracted.] [I think I know why.|Hm?]

@rule you.peep.teacher
on you
when realverb=seen_girls_room|seen_lockers role=teacher
feel serious
hook f_you_peep_teacher
opens deny,admit,hush
- {classes}[I should give you a formal warning until graduation.|A professor can't ignore that.] [What were you doing in there?|Explain yourself.]
- {classes}[The girls' side is off limits, as you know.|I heard where you were.] [I'll have to tell your academic advisor.|That was a warning. The only one.]
- [Do you want me to call the dean?|That's a matter for student affairs.] [Think carefully before you answer.|Well?]

# ================= gossip about a teacher, and gossip from a teacher =================
@rule gossip.teacher.couple
on gossip
when realverb=started_dating|engaged|dated|had_h|seen_together whorole=teacher role=student
feel shy
hook f_gossip_teacher_couple
opens ask,agree,defend
- [Did you hear about {who}?!|This is about a professor!] [{Deed}!|Word is that {deed}.] [The whole class is losing it.|I can't look at her in class.]
- [Nobody's supposed to know this.|Promise you won't tell.] [{Who}! Our professor!|It's {who}.] [Apparently {deed}.|{Src} told me.]
- [Professors are people too, I guess.|I never thought of a professor like that.] [But {deed}?|Still, {who}...]

@rule gossip.teacher.fight
on gossip
when realverb=fought|insulted whorole=teacher role=student
feel worried
hook f_gossip_teacher_fight
opens ask,agree,defend
- [{Who} got into it with someone.|There was a scene with {who}.] [{Deed}.|Nobody dared to breathe.]
- [You should've seen {who}.|I've never seen {who} like that.] [The whole hallway went quiet.|{Deed}, can you believe it?]
- [Don't tell anyone I told you.|It's all over the university.] [{Deed}.|A professor, of all people.]

@rule gossip.asteacher.student
on gossip
when role=teacher whorole=student
feel serious
hook f_gossip_asteacher_student
opens ask,agree,defend
- {classes}[I shouldn't repeat this about a student.|A professor hears things.] [{Deed}.|{Who}, from my class...] [Keep an eye on her for me.|I worry about that girl.]
- [Students think we don't notice.|We notice everything.] [{Deed}.|I know about {who}.] [I'll have a word with her.|Hm.]
- {classes}[{Who} is a good kid.|{Who} has more going on than her grades show.] [Still, {deed}.|I wish she'd come to me.]

@rule gossip.asteacher.colleague
on gossip
when role=teacher whorole=teacher
feel smile
hook f_gossip_asteacher_colleague
opens ask,agree,defend
- {classes}[This doesn't leave the faculty room.|You didn't hear it from me.] [{Deed}.|It's about {who}.] [Professors gossip worse than you lot.|Don't quote me.]
- [{Who} and I share a desk, so I'd know.|The faculty room has been buzzing.] [{Deed}.|Apparently {deed}.]
- [I respect {who}, of course.|{Who} is a fine colleague.] [But {deed}.|Even so.]

# ================= small talk that a student would answer differently =================
@rule small.exams.teacher
on small
when subject=exams role=teacher
hook f_small_exams_teacher
opens ask,tease,comfort
- {classes}[Don't ask me what's on the test.|I wrote the exam last night.] [Nice try.|It's fair. Mostly.]
- {classes}[You think exams are hard for you?|Who do you think has to grade all of that?] [I do.|Forty papers, per class.]
- {classes}[Study the chapters I told you to.|If you listened in class, you'll be fine.] [Hint, hint.|That's all you get.]

@rule small.school.teacher
on small
when subject=school role=teacher
hook f_small_school_teacher
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[Campus looks different from the front of the room.|The faculty room is another world.] [You'd be surprised.|Students have no idea.]
- {classes}[Your year is a lively one.|I've seen a lot of classes pass through.] [I'll miss you lot.|That's not a compliment.]
- [The building's old, the budget's small.|We do what we can here.] [I wouldn't trade it, though.|Mostly.]

@rule small.future.teacher
on small
when subject=future role=teacher
hook f_small_future_teacher
opens ask,share,praise
- {classes}[I wanted to be a professor since I was your age.|I had a professor who changed my life.] [I'm trying to be that for someone.|That's why I'm here.]
- [I'll probably stay here until they carry me out.|Some days I think about a smaller campus.] [Who knows?|Don't tell the dean.]
- [More important is your future.|I've seen where I'm going. What about you?] [Have you thought about it?|Your plans are on my desk, you know.]

@rule small.weekend.teacher
on small
when subject=weekend role=teacher
hook f_small_weekend_teacher
opens ask,share,tease
- {classes}[My weekend? Grading, laundry, and sleeping.|Professors don't vanish on Friday, you know.] [Very glamorous.|I may buy groceries.]
- {classes}[You'd be shocked how boring I am on a Sunday.|I keep my weekends far from the university.] [I don't even own a red pen at home. I lie.|Don't look for me.]
- [I'll go somewhere no student can find me.|If you see me in town, you didn't.] [Understood?|Hehe.]

@rule small.lunch.teacher
on small
when subject=lunch role=teacher
hook f_small_lunch_teacher
opens ask,invite,tease
- {classes}[Lunch at my desk, again.|I eat with a stack of papers.] [That's teaching.|The cafeteria's better than the faculty room.]
- {classes}[The faculty room smells like instant coffee.|Bento from the convenience store, the professor's friend.] [Every day.|Don't judge.]
- [Students get a whole hour for lunch.|My lunch break is twelve minutes between meetings.] [Enjoy it now.|I envy you.]

# ================= being touched and being quiet with a girlfriend who is your teacher =================
@rule touch.teacher.gf
on touch
when role=teacher rel=girlfriend|lover level=welcome
feel love
- [Not during class hours...|Mm... someone could come in.] [But I won't stop you.|Lock the door next time.]
- [You're still my student here.|Ah... I told you, not on campus.] [...A little longer.|You never listen in class either.]
- [I'm supposed to be setting an example.|This isn't what they mean by private tutoring.] [Hehe.|Mm.]

@rule idle.teacher.gf
on idle
when role=teacher rel=girlfriend|lover
- {classes}[I like that you stay after class.|Nobody needs to know why you're here.] [Sit with me.|I'll grade, you stay.]
- [It's nice, not having to be "sensei" for a minute.|You can stop calling me sensei when it's just us.] [Mm.|Quietly, though.]
- {classes}[I should be working.|This pile of papers can wait.] [Stay.|A little.]

# ================= the talk with both: teacher and student =================
@rule duo3.open.a.teacher.student
on duo3.open.a
when role=teacher otherrole=student
- [Ah, you too. I was just talking to {other}.|Well, two of my students at once.|Oh, you're here. {other} was asking me something.]
- {classes}[Good timing. I was telling {other} to study.|Hm? Don't mind us, it's just campus business.]
- [Here's another one who should be studying.|You two know each other, then.]

@rule duo3.open.b.student.teacher
on duo3.open.b
when role=student otherrole=teacher
- [S-sensei was just helping me.|We were only talking, I swear.|Hi... {other} caught me in the hallway.]
- {classes}[I'm not in trouble, am I?|{other} was asking about my assignments.]
- {classes}[Hey. Careful, {other} is in a professor mood.|Thank goodness, you can save me from {other}.]

@rule duo3.open.a.student.teacher
on duo3.open.a
when role=student otherrole=teacher
- [Oh! Sensei's here too.|Ah... {other} is with me.|Stand up straight, it's {other}.]
- {classes}[I was asking {other} about the test.|Good timing, {other} is telling me off.]
- [Um, you know {other}, right?|Say hello to {other}.]

@rule duo3.open.b.teacher.student
on duo3.open.b
when role=teacher otherrole=student
- {classes}[Good day. Don't let me interrupt.|Mm. I hope you two are behaving.|Are you in the same class as {other}?]
- [Don't mind me. I'm off duty, in theory.|I can see you, you know.]
- [Hello. Keep {other} out of trouble.|I was just leaving. Probably.]

@rule duo3.end.a.teacher.student
on duo3.end.a
when role=teacher otherrole=student
- {classes}[I have papers to grade. Don't stay out too late, you two.|Well, back to work for me.]
- {classes}[Go home on time, both of you.|Class starts early tomorrow.]
- {classes}[That's enough for today. Study.|Don't forget your assignments.]

@rule duo3.end.b.student.teacher
on duo3.end.b
when role=student otherrole=teacher
- {classes}[Thank you, sensei.|See you in class, sensei.|Yes, sensei. Good night.]
- {classes}[I'll go before I get more assignments.|Bye, sensei!]
- [Phew. Bye.|We'll behave. Probably.]

# ================= the talk with both: two teachers =================
@rule duo3.open.a.colleagues
on duo3.open.a
when role=teacher otherrole=teacher
- {classes}[Oh, a student. We were just complaining about the budget.|Ah, one of yours, {other}?|Don't mind us. It's a professors' meeting, of a kind.]
- {classes}[{other} and I were comparing grades. Don't look.|Here comes trouble, {other}.]
- [We were talking about you, actually.|{other} says you're quite a handful.]

@rule duo3.open.b.colleagues
on duo3.open.b
when role=teacher otherrole=teacher
- {classes}[Good day. Is this about assignments?|Hello. {other} was just telling me about your class.|Hm, this one? Yes, I know this one.]
- [Don't look so nervous. Yet.|We don't bite. {other} might.]
- {classes}[Two professors at once. Unlucky.|You picked the wrong moment.]

@rule duo3.end.a.colleagues
on duo3.end.a
when role=teacher otherrole=teacher
- {classes}[Well, the papers won't grade themselves.|Back to the faculty room, {other}?]
- {classes}[We've taken enough of your time. Go study.|Shall we, {other}?]
- [My lecture starts soon. Off you go.|Coffee, {other}?]

@rule duo3.end.b.colleagues
on duo3.end.b
when role=teacher otherrole=teacher
- {classes}[Right behind you.|Behave, young man.|See you in class.]
- [Please, I need the caffeine.|Let's go before the dean finds us.]
- [Not a word about what you heard.|Faculty room secrets stay there.]

# ================= the talk with both: a line and its answer, together =================
@rule duo3.talk.teacher.student
on duo3.talk
when argue=no role=teacher otherrole=student
- {classes}Have you handed in your report, {other}? >> Almost, sensei. I swear.
- {classes}You were yawning in my class, {other}. >> Sorry, sensei.
- {classes}Your last test was better, {other}. Keep it up. >> Thank you, sensei.
- {classes}I expect more from you, {other}. >> I'll do better, sensei.
- Are you eating properly, {other}? >> It's going okay, I think.
- Don't think I didn't see that note, {other}. >> Ahaha... you noticed that?

@rule duo3.talk.student.teacher
on duo3.talk
when argue=no role=student otherrole=teacher
- {classes}Sensei, is the test going to be hard? >> Study and you won't need to ask.
- {classes}{other}, do you ever get a day off? >> That's classified.
- {classes}Sensei, what do professors do after class? >> We don't sleep. We recharge in the storage room.
- {classes}Is it true the professors have a secret snack drawer? >> Nice try.
- {classes}Sensei, did you go to this university too? >> Ask me after the exams.
- {other}, were you a good student? >> Ask me again when you've graduated.

@rule duo3.talk.colleagues
on duo3.talk
when argue=no role=teacher otherrole=teacher
- {classes}{other}, did you read the dean's memo? >> I'm pretending that memo doesn't exist.
- {classes}Your class was loud today, {other}. >> Mine are worse, believe me.
- {classes}Do you still have my red pen, {other}? >> That pen was never yours.
- {classes}How many papers do you have left, {other}? >> Forty left. Pray for me.
- {classes}Did you finish your report for the office, {other}? >> Don't remind me.
- We should go for a drink after work, {other}. >> Friday, then. I'm buying.
- Is it just me, or is the coffee getting worse? >> Not in front of the students.
